---
import {referenceRank,unitPrice,catalog} from '../data/selection';
const {kind='budget'}=Astro.props;const rows=referenceRank(kind);const excluded=catalog.filter(b=>!rows.some(r=>r.b.slug===b.slug));
---
<div class="rank-toolbar"><label for="rank-search">搜索榜内品牌</label><input class="search-input" type="search" id="rank-search" placeholder="输入品牌名称"/><span class="status" id="rank-count" aria-live="polite">{rows.length} 个参考候选</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="reference-ranking"><caption>{kind==='overall'?'满足至少 200GB/月的最低支出':kind==='value'?'各品牌最低标称元/GB月付档':'各品牌最低参考月付档'} · CNY · 未计优惠</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">参考序位</th><th scope="col">品牌 / 套餐</th><th scope="col">月付金额</th><th scope="col">月流量</th><th scope="col">标称元/GB</th><th scope="col">优惠码</th><th scope="col">操作</th></tr></thead><tbody>{rows.map(r=><tr data-rank-brand={r.b.name.toLowerCase()}><td><span class="rank-number">{rows.filter(x=>Math.abs(x.value-r.value)<1e-9).length>1?'并列 ':''}{r.rank}</span></td><td><a href={`/airport/${r.b.slug}/`}>{r.b.name}</a><small>{r.p.name}</small></td><td><strong>¥{r.p.price}</strong><small>实际月付</small></td><td>{r.p.trafficPeriod==='month'&&r.p.trafficGB?`${r.p.trafficGB} GB`:'待核实'}</td><td>{unitPrice(r.p)!==undefined?`¥${unitPrice(r.p)!.toFixed(3)}`:'不计算'}</td><td><code>{r.b.coupon??'暂未提供'}</code></td><td><a href={`/compare/?brands=${r.b.slug}`}>加入比较 ↗</a><a href={r.b.sourceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">资料来源 ↗</a></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><p class="muted">序位仅表示本表指标大小；同值并列，不代表速度、稳定性、隐私或服务质量。元/GB 按标称容量计算，倍率待确认。</p>{excluded.length>0&&<details class="rank-exclusions"><summary>未进入本表的 {excluded.length} 个品牌与原因</summary><ul>{excluded.map(b=><li><a href={`/airport/${b.slug}/`}>{b.name}</a>：{b.status==='disputed'?'套餐归属存在疑点':b.status==='missing'?'指定来源未收录':kind==='overall'?'缺少符合 200GB 需求的明确月付档':'没有符合本表规则的套餐'}</li>)}</ul></details>}
<script>const input=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#rank-search');input?.addEventListener('input',()=>{let n=0;document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-rank-brand]').forEach(row=>{row.hidden=!row.dataset.rankBrand!.includes(input.value.trim().toLowerCase());if(!row.hidden)n++;});document.querySelector('#rank-count')!.textContent=`显示 ${n} 个参考候选；原表序位保留`;});</script>
